		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Celestial soldier sheathed head to toe in thick armor. One forearm ends in a lance, the other arm is a shield.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16 (+1 plate mail), <strong>HP</strong> 26, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 +2 spear +5 (1d6+2), <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Divine Aura</strong>. Hostile spells targeting the archon are DC 15. Spear and armor dissolve if slain.</p><p></p><p><strong>Unyielding</strong>. The archon may not be pushed, shoved, or moved against their will.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
